    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Hentai Glass!</h2>A unique puzzle where art and beauty meet in vintage Japanese glass frames. This game is a journey through glass and puzzles, where each level represents a new opportunity to create something beautiful.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the game:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464500/extras/8c481d751ad9f7ffba915051c6603be9.poster.avif?t=1723772164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464500/extras/8c481d751ad9f7ffba915051c6603be9.webm?t=1723772164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464500/extras/8c481d751ad9f7ffba915051c6603be9.mp4?t=1723772164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>80 exciting levels: Immerse yourself in two different parts of the game. The first half offers to collect vintage glass works with Japanese motifs - from landscapes to mythical creatures. The second half is dedicated to anime, where you collect pieces to create gorgeous images of anime girls.<br></li><li>Unique gameplay: Start with a frame and add glass fragments to create fascinating works of art. Use the hints to make the task easier.<br></li><li>Simple mechanics: Intuitive gameplay will make even beginners in this genre feel at home.<br></li><li>Relaxing music: Accompanying each level with relaxing melodies creates the perfect atmosphere for puzzles.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements: Get special achievements by completing levels.</li></ul><br>Hentai Glass is perfect for fans of puzzles and Japanese. The game offers both challenge and relaxation, making it an ideal choice for short breaks or long gaming sessions.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Hentai Glass!</h2>A unique puzzle where art and beauty meet in vintage Japanese glass frames. This game is a journey through glass and puzzles, where each level represents a new opportunity to create something beautiful.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the game:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464500/extras/8c481d751ad9f7ffba915051c6603be9.poster.avif?t=1723772164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464500/extras/8c481d751ad9f7ffba915051c6603be9.webm?t=1723772164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464500/extras/8c481d751ad9f7ffba915051c6603be9.mp4?t=1723772164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>80 exciting levels: Immerse yourself in two different parts of the game. The first half offers to collect vintage glass works with Japanese motifs - from landscapes to mythical creatures. The second half is dedicated to anime, where you collect pieces to create gorgeous images of anime girls.<br></li><li>Unique gameplay: Start with a frame and add glass fragments to create fascinating works of art. Use the hints to make the task easier.<br></li><li>Simple mechanics: Intuitive gameplay will make even beginners in this genre feel at home.<br></li><li>Relaxing music: Accompanying each level with relaxing melodies creates the perfect atmosphere for puzzles.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements: Get special achievements by completing levels.</li></ul><br>Hentai Glass is perfect for fans of puzzles and Japanese. The game offers both challenge and relaxation, making it an ideal choice for short breaks or long gaming sessions.",
    "short_description": "Hentai Glass - discover a great casual puzzle game. A puzzle game where you have to collect Japanese vintage glass paintings and anime girls. 80 levels, two unique styles, relaxing music and Steam achievements are waiting for you!",
